  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO Burkina Faso 2020-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INSO Burkina Faso 2020-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global objective: 
Improved protection of relief personnel and improved effectiveness of humanitarian and development action
Specific objective:
Humanitarian and development organizations in Burkina Faso have access to timely, reliable, and high-quality safety services that help them plan, operate and deliver aid more safely.
Expected Results:
R1. Information, Analysis and Advice  Credible, reliable, and high-quality safety information, analysis and advice is provided collectively to NGOs in a timely and appropriate manner.
R2.&#xa0;Preparedness &amp; Response - NGOs are supported in their own preparedness, security, and crisis management capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett institutionellt st&#xf6;d (&quot;core support&quot;) som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos den icke-statliga organisationen &quot;International NGO Safety Organisation/INSO&quot; i Burkina Faso f&#xf6;r att ge information och utbildning till icke-statliga och icke vinstdrivande humanit&#xe4;ra och utvecklingsorganisationer s&#xe5; att dessa kan arbeta med mindre risk och d&#xe4;rmed mer effektivt i konfliktmilj&#xf6;er. Att st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r institutionellt inneb&#xe4;r att INSO har st&#xf6;rre flexibilitet &#xe4;n normalt i att anv&#xe4;nda den svenska finansieringen f&#xf6;r aktiviteter som saknar finansiering fr&#xe5;n andra givare men som &#xe4;r viktiga f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; programmets m&#xe5;l.

Det totala finansiella st&#xf6;det uppg&#xe5;r till 12 miljoner kr och ges under 3-&#xe5;rsperioden (aktivitetsperioden) 1 oktober 2020 - 30 september 2023.

Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r som f&#xf6;ljer:

Utvecklingsm&#xe5;l: F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat st&#xf6;d till bist&#xe5;ndspersonal och &#xf6;kad effektivitet av humanit&#xe4;r hj&#xe4;lp och utvecklingsst&#xf6;d.

Specifikt m&#xe5;l: Humanit&#xe4;ra och utvecklingsorganisationer i Burkina Faso har tillg&#xe5;ng till l&#xe4;glig, p&#xe5;litlig och h&#xf6;gkvalitativa tj&#xe4;nster som till&#xe5;ter dem att planera och genomf&#xf6;ra sina st&#xf6;d&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder p&#xe5; ett mindre riskfyllt s&#xe4;tt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative is an institutional support (&quot;core support&quot;) aimed at strengthening the capacity of the non-governmental &quot;International NGO Safety Organization / INSO&quot; in Burkina Faso to provide information and training to non-governmental and non-profit humanitarian and development organizations so that these can work with less risk and thus more effectively in conflict environments. The institutional support can be used by INSO with more flexibility than usual in order to fund activities that lack funding from other donors but are essential for achieving the program&apos;s objectives.

The total financial support amounts to SEK 12 million and is given during the 3-year (activity) period 1 October 2020 - 30 September 2023.

The goals of the effort are as follows:

Global objective: Improved protection of relief personnel and improved effectiveness of humanitarian and development action

Specific objective: Humanitarian and development organizations in Burkina Faso have access to timely, reliable, and high-quality safety services that help them plan, operate and deliver aid more safely.</narrative>
  </description>
